，咖啡因总量不超过 400 mg，不加糖不加奶盖"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-27","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"每天吃够 5 份（约 400 g）水果蔬菜"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-28","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"少吃超加工食品（薯片、方便面、糕点、速食）"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-29","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"做饭、取暖不烧煤和柴，换成电或燃气"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-30","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"热的东西放一放再喝，不喝滚烫的茶、汤和咖啡"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-31","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"白天出门晒晒太阳，别整天不见光"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-32","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"把 BMI 控制在 20–25，超重就减"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-33","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"每周吃四次以上辣椒"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-34","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"每天喝一两份奶或酸奶"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-35","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"鸡蛋不用戒，但别每天三四个"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-36","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"有条件就泡澡，别只冲淋浴"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-37","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"把午睡控制在半小时内，别超过一小时，非得睡一两小时才撑得住就去查原因"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-38","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"熬夜之后第二天晚上就补觉，别攒到周末"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-39","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"上夜班干得越久心血管风险越高，能转岗就趁早转"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-40","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"买预包装、有 SC 编号的食用油，不买小作坊散装自榨花生油"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-41","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"做饭用植物油代替猪油和黄油，不必为了健康换着买油，也别指望亚麻籽油护心"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-42","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"炒菜、煎炸时打开抽油烟机，从开火一直开到做完"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-43","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"绝经前后潮热盗汗影响到生活，就去妇科评估激素治疗，别硬扛也别自己买药，更别拿它防心脏病"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-44","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"本来就想养狗的，把每天遛狗算进走路量，别为了长寿专门去养狗"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-45","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["45"]},"查出糖尿病前期（血糖偏高、还没到糖尿病），就靠少吃、减重、多动把糖尿病往后推，每半年复查一次血糖"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-46","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["46"]},"家里的花生、玉米、坚果和米面发了霉，整包扔掉，别挑掉霉的吃剩下的；嚼到发苦的坚果马上吐掉"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-47","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["47"]},"别吃淡水鱼虾做的鱼生、生鱼片、鱼生粥和醉虾，常吃过的去医院查一次肝吸虫，查出来按医嘱吃吡喹酮"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh,en,ru,es,ja,vi"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/02"},"children":["第 2 章 · 不要慢慢死"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"02-26"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["26"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["证据 A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["每天喝三到四杯咖啡，咖啡因总量不超过 400 mg，不加糖不加奶盖"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["每天喝三到四杯咖啡的人，同期死亡的概率比不喝的人低约 17%。另一项研究里，咖啡集中在上午喝的人低约 12%，全天都喝的人看不出差别。一杯咖啡的咖啡因含量差得很大，要按一天总量不超过 400 mg 来控制。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["自己冲每天一两元。冲一杯几分钟，不占什么时间。买大杯的要留意一天喝了多少毫克咖啡因。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["一篇综述汇总了 201 项观察性研究的汇总分析，这些汇总底下的原始研究都只记录、不分组。总死亡率这一项，综述引用了其中一篇剂量与效果关系的汇总分析。每天 3–4 杯咖啡的人和不喝的人比，死亡风险低 17%（相对风险 0.83，95% CI 0.79–0.88，这是可信范围）。每天 7 杯时，降幅缩小…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：每天喝三到四杯咖啡，咖啡因总量不超过 400 mg，不加糖不加奶盖"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["自己冲每天一两元。冲一杯几分钟，不占什么时间。买大杯的要留意一天喝了多少毫克咖啡因。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["一篇综述汇总了 201 项观察性研究的汇总分析，这些汇总底下的原始研究都只记录、不分组。总死亡率这一项，综述引用了其中一篇剂量与效果关系的汇总分析。每天 3–4 杯咖啡的人和不喝的人比，死亡风险低 17%（相对风险 0.83，95% CI 0.79–0.88，这是可信范围）。每天 7 杯时，降幅缩小到 10%（相对风险 0.90，95% CI 0.85–0.96），没有看到风险回升。美国国家健康与营养调查（NHANES）的一项研究，跟踪了 40 725 名成年人，一半人跟踪满了 9.8 年，也是只记录、不分组。研究把喝咖啡的人分成两类。上午型是咖啡集中在 4:00–11:59 喝、下午和晚上几乎不喝的人，占 36%。他们和不喝咖啡的人比，全因死亡风险低 12%（风险比 0.88，95% CI 0.81–0.96）。再扣除睡眠不足和睡眠困难的影响，低 16%（风险比 0.84，95% CI 0.74–0.95）。心血管病死亡风险低 19%（风险比 0.81，95% CI 0.70–0.94）。扣除睡眠影响后，低 31%（风险比 0.69，95% CI 0.55–0.87）。全天型是上午、下午和晚上都喝的人，占 16%。他们的全因死亡风险看不出差别（风险比 0.99，95% CI 0.90–1.10）。两类人的癌症死亡风险都看不出差别。咖啡因的每日上限有官方依据。欧洲食品安全局（EFSA）和加拿大卫生部都把健康成年人的上限定为每天 400 mg。这是所有来源合计，茶、可乐和能量饮料也要算。EFSA 还要求分散在一天里喝，单次不超过 200 mg。一杯咖啡的含量差得很大。EFSA 的表里，200 mL 一杯滤泡咖啡约 90 mg。加拿大卫生部的表里，8 盎司（237 mL）一杯现煮咖啡平均 135 mg。美国食品药品监督管理局（FDA）的表里，12 盎司（约 355 mL）现煮咖啡含 113–247 mg。所以 FDA 把 400 mg 折成约 2 到 3 杯 12 盎司的咖啡，综述折成约 4 杯。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Poole R, Kennedy OJ, Roderick P, et al. (2017). Coffee consumption and health: umbrella review of meta-analyses of multiple health outcomes. BMJ, 359, j5024. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.j5024","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.j5024"]},"，含更正 BMJ (2018), 360, k194. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.k194","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.k194"]},"（摘要里总死亡率的可信范围由 0.83–0.88 改为 0.79–0.88）；Wang X, Ma H, Sun Q, et al. (2025). Coffee drinking timing and mortality in US adults. European Heart Journal, 46(8), 749-759. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehae871","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/eurheartj/ehae871"]},"；Yang R, Lei Q, Liu Z, et al. (2024). Relationship between timing of coffee and tea consumption with mortality (total, cardiovascular disease and diabetes) in people with diabetes: the U.S. National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey, 2003–2014. BMC Medicine, 22, 526. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12916-024-03736-x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1186/s12916-024-03736-x"]},"；EFSA Panel on Dietetic Products, Nutrition and Allergies (2015). Scientific Opinion on the safety of caffeine. EFSA Journal, 13(5), 4102. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2903/j.efsa.2015.4102","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.2903/j.efsa.2015.4102"]},"；EFSA 咖啡因专题页（每份含量表）",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.efsa.europa.eu/en/topics/topic/caffeine","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.efsa.europa.eu/en/topics/topic/caffeine"]},"；FDA. Spilling the Beans: How Much Caffeine Is Too Much? ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.fda.gov/consumers/consumer-updates/spilling-beans-how-much-caffeine-too-much","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.fda.gov/consumers/consumer-updates/spilling-beans-how-much-caffeine-too-much"]},"；Health Canada. Caffeine in foods. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.canada.ca/en/health-canada/services/food-nutrition/food-safety/food-additives/caffeine-foods.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.canada.ca/en/health-canada/services/food-nutrition/food-safety/food-additives/caffeine-foods.html"]},"；加糖：Liu D, Li ZH, Shen D, et al. (2022). Association of Sugar-Sweetened, Artificially Sweetened, and Unsweetened Coffee Consumption With All-Cause and Cause-Specific Mortality. Annals of Internal Medicine, 175(7), 909-917. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.7326/M21-2977","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.7326/M21-2977"]},"；Treskes RW, Clausen J, Marott JL, et al. (2023). Use of sugar in coffee and tea and long-term risk of mortality in older adult Danish men. PLOS ONE, 18(10), e0292882. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0292882","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0292882"]},"；房颤：Wong CX, Cheung CC, Montenegro G, et al. (2026). Caffeinated Coffee Consumption or Abstinence to Reduce Atrial Fibrillation. JAMA, 335(4), 317-325. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2025.21056","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2025.21056"]},"；Joglar JA, Chung MK, Armbruster AL, et al. (2024). 2023 ACC/AHA/ACCP/HRS Guideline for the Diagnosis and Management of Atrial Fibrillation. Circulation, 149(1). ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1161/CIR.0000000000001193","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1161/CIR.0000000000001193"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["争议在于：综述作者写明证据大部分来自只跟踪记录的研究，要靠可靠的随机对照试验，才能判断是不是因果。上午喝更好这一点只有一个美国研究，所以没写进标题，作者写明结果不能解释为因果，也可能只是上午喝咖啡的人整体生活更健康。另一项只含糖尿病患者的美国研究里，黎明到上午喝咖啡的人死亡风险高 25%，上午到中午喝的人低 20%，结果相反。这些研究都没有比较 12 点和 14 点哪个更合适。第 3 节第 4 条（下午两点以后不碰咖啡因）讲的是睡眠，要按自己的就寝时间往前推，和这条不冲突。400 mg 是安全上限，不是有益的剂量。无咖啡因的咖啡也有类似的好处，只是略小，所以不用为了凑量多喝。孕妇每天不超过 200 mg（EFSA）或 300 mg（加拿大卫生部）。骨折风险高的女性不适用这一条。焦虑、失眠的人也不适用，这是本书的判断，综述里没有这两类人的结论。有房颤的人不必一律戒咖啡。一项试验里，持续性房颤电复律后每天喝约 1 杯咖啡的人，复发比戒咖啡的人少（47% 对 64%）。2023 年美国房颤指南也不建议为预防发作戒咖啡，但喝了会诱发症状的人要减。其他心律失常没有证据，听医生的。死亡率这一项没有看到加糖会抵消好处。但糖浆和奶盖类饮品没有研究，糖量又大，所以仍然建议不加。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/02-25"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"每周喝三次以上茶"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/02-27"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"每天吃够 5 份（约 400 g）水果蔬菜"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-22"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["每天吃一小把坚果"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["常吃坚果的人，同期死亡的概率比不吃的人低约两成。一周吃一次就能看出差别，低约一成。吃到每天一把，差别最明显。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-23"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把一部分红肉换成鱼和禽肉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["每周多吃两份加工肉或者红肉，同期死亡的概率高约 3%。换成同样份数的鱼或者禽肉，就看不出升高。这条的效应在本节里偏小，属于顺手就换、不必较劲的事。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-24"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把一部分精米白面换成全谷物"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["每天多吃 90 g 全谷物的人，同期死亡的概率低约 17%。90 g 大约是三份。吃到每天 200 g 左右，还在继续往下降。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-28"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["少吃超加工食品（薯片、方便面、糕点、速食）"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["超加工食品吃得最多的人，同期死亡的概率比吃得最少的人高约两成，心血管死亡高五成。不过这类证据被评为不太确定，数字要往回打折看。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-29"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["做饭、取暖不烧煤和柴，换成电或燃气"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["做饭烧煤或烧柴的人，同期死亡的概率高约一成；取暖烧煤柴的高约 14%。已经改用电或燃气的人，比还在烧煤柴的人死亡概率低 13%–33%。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/02-30"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["热的东西放一放再喝，不喝滚烫的茶、汤和咖啡"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["喝很烫的茶，得食管癌的概率是喝温茶的 8 倍。就算只是「热」，也有 2 倍。倒出来不到两分钟就喝，风险是等四分钟以上再喝的 5 倍。"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/02"},"children":["阅读整个主题：不要慢慢死 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-